单打或双打、允许的规则，再确定核心成员承担的角色。检查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","contentHash":"sha256:88e9cc038dee345a04f64543e8a95ec386e6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"reference-vs-rules-v1","title":"图鉴资料、版本与比赛规则的区别","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"版本 规则 合法性 资料 来源 图鉴 pokeapi 排位 最新 强势","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本说明由项目编写，资料接口字段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["reference"]}},"score":5840,"checksum":"sha256:80eab54b4416ed9ee323fbee2efb79e3225dae0a5efa7cd4f8079d369e6fd46b","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-e2992d691aac2ee5897c1264d3f178b9b8bd443cc16b544708e983c68543afcc","documentVersion":"sha256:f4f8a628ee878c8ff6fb7f0fdc547b02ca6203c0e2a2a4e0b6a719fa1bbc0430","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":218,"text":"本说明由项目编写，资料接口字段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","contentHash":"sha256:646ecf409f2ddb19c067dd0978eb3aecf62924e395a81f58848a83780baaa163"}},{"document":{"id":"team-change-confirmation-v1","title":"从AI建议到队伍保存的确认流程","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"队伍 修改 预览 确认 保存 取消 并发 冲突 等级","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。\n\n预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["project"]}},"score":5245,"checksum":"sha256:41c555cc67408cb4ddf470c23dc90bdec6230f4f330c8c33ba4762777eabb976","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-ef248d8303fab055bd6c49179810ca0be35fac5a5615b3460092d055533ff522","documentVersion":"sha256:83175ceac095f48bee8896bb5e6cbde7d8ad417c22c1b6a38eb14f023450c6ea","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":287,"text":"预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","contentHash":"sha256:d820cfe8f51da68ee49319ad8cec7abd979e363831631dc7d7135fa35ba1ec4e"}},{"document":{"id":"species-form-identity-v1","title":"查询资料时区分物种、形态与编号","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"物种 形态 编号 slug 名字 form species 图鉴 查询","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"这份笔记说明本项目如何识别查询对象，不是物种强度或参赛名单。查询前先确认想了解的是哪一种形态。项目资料适配器分别读取宝可梦资源与物种资源；formId来自宝可梦资源编号，speciesId和全国编号来自物种资源，slug保留宝可梦资源名称。物种与形态的标识不能互相替代。回答和队伍配置应围绕同一个formId，不要只凭中文名称合并资料。\n\n遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["reference"]}},"score":4847,"checksum":"sha256:1e072067cf84cbf202f49f5662d9939dcbba2173aa6691027761216f866784d7","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-7e6601704c34f8abb9d4352fb6a5104d46eed7159bb547f37892e1d4e2067145","documentVersion":"sha256:e4bf71833425a866cfa35a6a2dd4df2ebfbea9fe7dc4f7e7d64fc869c3274583","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":170,"endOffset":319,"text":"遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","contentHash":"sha256:5f52b20fb6f744e63661e12e566b49fc4559b4c41131b0c8a4525ac730b7cb55"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@66e410df}
